secubox-led-heartbeat (2.1.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * NEW: Activity-based brightness (ACTIVE=100, SLEEP=20)
  * NEW: K2000 (Knight Rider) sweep effect for boot/alerts
  * NEW: Commands: k2000, success, boot, alert, rainbow
  * IMPROVED: Aligned I2C timing with secubox-led-safe (300ms)
  * IMPROVED: Simplified to POSIX /bin/sh
  * IMPROVED: I2C bus recovery via platform driver rebind
  * FIX: Removed unstable connect/activity flash

